---
layout: layouts/page.liquid
title: Scroll View
permalink: /scroll/
description: "Read Anno Arcana a whole chapter at a time: pick a chapter and scroll through every page on one page."
---
{% comment %}
The Scroll View menu: every chapter as a card that opens it on one long page
(chapter-read.liquid). Story chapters first, then the lore interludes.
{% endcomment %}
<p>Pick a chapter to read it from start to finish on one long page.</p>
{%- assign story = collections.chapterReads | where_exp: "ch", "ch.number > 0" %}
{%- assign lore = collections.chapterReads | where_exp: "ch", "ch.number == 0" %}
<ol class="scroll-chapters">
  {%- for ch in story %}{% render 'scrollCard.liquid', ch: ch %}{% endfor %}
  {%- for ch in lore %}{% render 'scrollCard.liquid', ch: ch %}{% endfor %}
</ol>
